`GunDef.CanAds` gates `SetAiming`. Everything downstream (spread bonus, ground
speed cap, viewmodel pull-in, third-person camera) keys off `IsAiming`, so one gate
covers all of it. Asserted per gun in the same harness.

**Rockets were technically visible but useless to track** — a few pixels plus a
light pool on the floor. Enlarged the body, added a dimmer glow shell so it has a
silhouette against bright walls too, brightened the light, and added an ember
trail dropped every 22 ms and faded over 450 ms. A lone moving dot does not
communicate travel; a receding line of embers does. `test/TestRocketFlight.tscn`
films it side-on down a 40 m range.

**Training weapon picker.** `TrainingConfig.Gun` plus a Weapon row on the setup
